00:58:34.638 --> 00:58:37.010
They want multiple sport participation.

00:58:37.350 --> 00:58:42.334
Number four, they want fun and engaging and progressively challenging climates.

00:58:42.462 --> 00:58:46.398
And then number five, they want quality coaching at all ages.

00:58:46.574 --> 00:58:53.006
And so their model has a stepwise system and it has multiple functions and criteria.

00:58:53.118 --> 00:58:55.658
So their model, number one, is called stage one.

00:58:55.814 --> 00:58:58.910
So stage one is what they call develop and learn and play.

00:58:59.290 --> 00:59:02.670
This is appropriate for anyone ages 0 to 12.

