What they're really saying here is, look, you might be 10 years old, but you have one year of experience.

00:59:10.650 --> 00:59:13.666
You start at stage one, you're not starting at stage three.

00:59:13.818 --> 00:59:20.498
And so rather than defining these stages by age or defining it by experience levels.

00:59:20.674 --> 00:59:22.338
So stage one, develop, learn and play.

00:59:22.394 --> 00:59:25.428
