01:00:11.030 --> 01:00:15.492
and mastery for life is you coming back and being a mentor.

01:00:15.606 --> 01:00:17.672
It is you being active the rest of your life.

01:00:17.776 --> 01:00:20.328
And so their athletic developmental model encompasses.

01:00:20.424 --> 01:00:24.616
We're not just going to let people walk out of this thing at 22 years old and they're broken

01:00:24.648 --> 01:00:27.000
