01:21:02.432 --> 01:21:03.900
Something a little bit shorter.

01:21:04.640 --> 01:21:09.384
The exercises, a tennis ball catch coach reaction drills.

01:21:09.432 --> 01:21:10.936
You could fill in a bunch of them here.

