01:22:04.286 --> 01:22:10.102
Nothing is to maximum fatigue, nothing is maximum load. Complicated movements, multiple steps.

01:22:10.206 --> 01:22:16.070
And we got a lot of stuff done in a total of, I don't know, 40 minutes including warmup, cooldown.

01:22:16.230 --> 01:22:19.766
We can't walk away from this entirely without talking about plyometrics.

01:22:19.798 --> 01:22:22.710
Just because I get a trillion questions about that.

