I remember actually I showed this in class for probably a decade.

01:22:32.278 --> 01:22:34.070
I think it was like WebMD.

01:22:34.230 --> 01:22:38.380
Yeah, it was WebMD where you would go on and they would just show you all the dangers about

01:22:38.420 --> 01:22:40.716
plyometrics and kids and don't do it and so forth.

01:22:40.748 --> 01:22:43.280
It's probably still up there. Honestly, I didn't check.

01:22:43.700 --> 01:22:47.916
So I bring it up for these exact reasons. Here's the rope. With plyometrics.

01:22:48.028 --> 01:22:50.620
We've already covered it all. It's common sense.

01:22:50.700 --> 01:22:53.324
Kids jump and land every day. It can be dangerous.

01:22:53.372 --> 01:22:54.444
Like anything can be dangerous.

01:22:54.492 --> 01:22:56.220
