They both wrote that book with a bunch of other people. It is fantastic.

01:42:31.086 --> 01:42:37.518
Avery Fagenbaum, I mentioned multiple times he has a book called Youth Strength Training also awesome.

01:42:37.694 --> 01:42:43.342
And then finally the American College of Sports Medicine has a book called Essentials of Youth

01:42:43.406 --> 01:42:51.198
Fitness written actually by Avery Fagenbaum, Rodri Lloyd and John Oliver, again, three super

01:42:51.254 --> 01:42:55.270
prominent scientists and practitioners in this field of ltad.

01:42:55.850 --> 01:43:01.990
They actually have a certification as well called the Youth Fitness Specialist certification.

01:43:02.410 --> 01:43:03.790
All of those are available.

