Something completely different that I couldn't do this episode without mentioning is something

01:43:25.780 --> 01:43:28.812
my friend Jim Davis created out of Chicago.

01:43:28.876 --> 01:43:31.960
It is called the Good Athlete Project.

01:43:32.260 --> 01:43:41.756
This is a combination of leadership and mental health and psychology smuggled into an exercise and sport program.

01:43:41.908 --> 01:43:44.396
The Good Athlete Project is phenomenal.

